 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\n7-Day Great Migration River Crossing\nAdventure\nENQUIRE NOW\n\n$3799pp\n\n*prices based on 6 people sharing\n\nBEST TIME TO TRAVEL\n\nJul - Early Oct\n\nDURATION\n\n7 Days\n\nLOCATIONS\n\nArusha, Tarangire, Serengeti,\nNgorongoro Crater\n\nSTARTING POINT\n\nFlight into Kilimanjaro\n\nEmbark on a remarkable seven-day safari in Tanzania, designed to immerse you in the breathtaking spectacle of the Great Migration. This journey covers Tarangire National Park, Central Serengeti, Northern Serengeti, and the iconic Ngorongoro Crater, offering unrivaled opportunities to witness nature's most awe-inspiring event. Each year, millions of wildebeest, zebras, and gazelles migrate across these vast plains, risking rivers and predators in their relentless quest for greener pastures. Alongside this natural marvel, explore the lush landscapes of Tarangire, the rich wildlife diversity of Serengeti’s central and northern regions, and the extraordinary Ngorongoro Crater. This expertly curated safari promises an unforgettable experience, where dramatic wildlife encounters and Tanzania's scenic beauty create a once-in-a-lifetime adventure.\n\nITINERARY\n\nDay 1\nDay 2\nDay 3\nDay 4\nDay 5\nDay 6\nDay 7\n​\n\nDay 1: Arrival in Arusha\n\n​\n\nUpon landing at the airport, you'll be warmly welcomed by our representative and driven to your accommodation in Arusha, about an hour away. Your knowledgeable safari guide is a true expert on Tanzania, ready to share insights on the nation's vibrant culture, spectacular national parks, and diverse wildlife. Don't hesitate to ask questions along the way. If you arrive early, consider adding one of the following exciting activities: canoeing on Lake Duluti or Momela, exploring a local coffee plantation, taking a village or town tour, or another adventure of your choosing (for an additional fee). Settle in and prepare for an extraordinary safari experience that starts tomorrow.\n\nMeal Plan\n\nBed & Breakfast\n\nAccomodation\n\nNgaresero Mountain Lodge\n\nDestination\n\nArusha is known as the safari capital of Tanzania's Northern Safari Circuit.\n\nPackage Price includes:\n\n• English speaking professional guide;\n\n• Meals and accommodation as specified in the itinerary \n\n• Private transportation by FWD vehicle equipped with open roof \n\n• Airport Transfers \n\n• Park Entry Fees, VAT inclusive\n\n• Unlimited (pure) drinking water throughout the safari's\n\n• Flying doctor \n\nPrices can vary between seasons\n\n$3799pp  6+ people\n\n$3999pp  4 people\n\n$4549pp  2 people \n\nPackage Price Does not include:\n\n• Airfares and related costs such as personal travel insurance, visas, and vaccinations;\n\n• Cost of any client-requested itinerary modifications while the safari is in progress;\n\n• Any expenses of a personal nature such as extra beverages, laundry, etc.;\n\n• Gratuity for your safari guides\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
